{"seq":2,"slug":"audience-segment-import","title":"受众分群与名单导入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/subscriber-audience-seg/audience-segment-import","wordCount":2336,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"受众分群与名单导入\">受众分群与名单导入</h1><p>分群（segmentation）在营销系统里的作用，是把一个可能有几千万条记录的订阅库，在几秒内收敛成一个具体的收件人列表。它的难点不在&quot;写一个 WHERE 条件&quot;，而在三件事：条件如何被表达与复用、大名单如何安全地批量进入系统、以及同一个人的多条记录如何被判定为同一个人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类分群条件\">核心概念：三类分群条件</h2><p>所有分群条件最终都归入三类，它们的计算成本与实时性要求截然不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>变化频率</th>\n<th>典型查询成本</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>属性条件</strong></td>\n<td>订阅档案静态字段</td>\n<td>低（天级）</td>\n<td>低，可预计算</td>\n<td>国家 = DE、语言 = de、注册渠道 = signup</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>行为条件</strong></td>\n<td>聚合后的互动统计</td>\n<td>中（小时级）</td>\n<td>中，需物化视图</td>\n<td>过去 30 天点击 ≥ 3 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>事件条件</strong></td>\n<td>明细事件流</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n<td>高，需实时管道</td>\n<td>过去 24 小时加购未下单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属性条件是分群的主力，应当尽量预计算成宽表上的列；行为条件需要一张按收件人聚合的滚动窗口表；事件条件如果要求秒级响应，就必须走流式处理而不是查询明细表。把三类条件混在一个 SQL 里对明细事件表做全表扫描，是分群查询慢到不可用的头号原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[分群规则定义] --&gt; B{条件类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|属性| C[宽表预计算列]&#10;  B --&gt;|行为| D[滚动窗口聚合表&lt;br/&gt;30/90/180 天]&#10;  B --&gt;|事件| E[流式管道&lt;br/&gt;实时特征]&#10;  C --&gt; F[规则编译为 SQL]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[实时受众缓存]&#10;  F --&gt; H[候选集物化]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[发送前与抑制名单求交]&#10;  I --&gt; J[最终收件人列表]\">graph TD\n  A[分群规则定义] --&gt; B{条件类型}\n  B --&gt;|属性| C[宽表预计算列]\n  B --&gt;|行为| D[滚动窗口聚合表&lt;br/&gt;30/90/180 天]\n  B --&gt;|事件| E[流式管道&lt;br/&gt;实时特征]\n  C --&gt; F[规则编译为 SQL]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[实时受众缓存]\n  F --&gt; H[候选集物化]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[发送前与抑制名单求交]\n  I --&gt; J[最终收件人列表]</pre><h2 id=\"分群规则的表达与编译\">分群规则的表达与编译</h2><p>规则的存储形态决定了它的可维护性。把规则存成一段自由文本 SQL 最省事，但无法做权限校验、无法做&quot;这个规则会命中多少人&quot;的预演、也无法阻止有人在规则里写出跨表 JOIN 拖垮数据库。更稳的做法是把规则表示成一个受限的 JSON 结构，再由编译器翻译成 SQL。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;segment_id&quot;: &quot;de_active_clickers_30d&quot;,&#10;  &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;and&quot;,&#10;  &quot;conditions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;attr.country&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: [&quot;DE&quot;, &quot;AT&quot;, &quot;CH&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;attr.marketing_consent&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;eq&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;behav.click_count_30d&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gte&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 3 },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;behav.last_open_days&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;lte&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 45 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;exclude_segments&quot;: [&quot;high_complaint_risk&quot;],&#10;  &quot;refresh&quot;: &quot;daily_0300_recipient_tz&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"segment_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_active_clickers_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"and\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attr.country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attr.marketing_consent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"behav.click_count_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"behav.last_open_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exclude_segments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high_complaint_risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"refresh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily_0300_recipient_tz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构有三个隐含约束：字段名走<strong>白名单</strong>（<code>attr.*</code> / <code>behav.*</code> 前缀映射到固定的几张表，杜绝任意 JOIN）；操作符集合受限（<code>in/eq/gte/lte/between/exists</code>）；<code>exclude_segments</code> 支持分群之间的引用，但必须做<strong>环检测</strong>——A 排除 B、B 排除 A 会编译成无限递归。<code>refresh</code> 声明刷新频率，让编译器可以决定走物化还是实时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"白名单为什么比校验更重要\">白名单为什么比校验更重要</h3><p>规则引擎的常见错误是先接受任意 SQL 片段、再用正则去&quot;过滤危险语法&quot;。这类黑名单式防护在 SQL 方言面前几乎总是漏的。白名单的结构性优势在于：编译器只认识有限的字段与操作符，任何不在枚举内的输入在<strong>编译期</strong>就被拒绝，而不需要判断它是否危险。地图边界由能力定义，而不是由禁词表定义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"环检测与深度上限\">环检测与深度上限</h3><p>分群引用除了环，还要防深度爆炸。<code>A 排除 B，B 排除 C，C 排除 D …</code> 链式引用如果允许无限嵌套，一次查询会退化成深层嵌套子查询。门诊做法是限制最大引用深度（如 3 层）并在规则保存时静态检查，而不是等运行超时才发现。</p>\n<p>编译出的 SQL 应当总是先取候选集、再在发送前与抑制名单求交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH candidates AS (&#10;  SELECT s.subscriber_id&#10;  FROM subscriber_wide s&#10;  WHERE s.country IN (&#39;DE&#39;,&#39;AT&#39;,&#39;CH&#39;)&#10;    AND s.marketing_consent = true&#10;    AND s.click_count_30d &gt;= 3&#10;    AND s.last_open_days &lt;= 45&#10;),&#10;excluded AS (&#10;  SELECT subscriber_id FROM segment_materialized WHERE segment_id = &#39;high_complaint_risk&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT c.subscriber_id&#10;FROM candidates c&#10;LEFT JOIN excluded e USING (subscriber_id)&#10;LEFT JOIN suppression sp ON sp.normalized_email = c.normalized_email&#10;WHERE e.subscriber_id IS NULL&#10;  AND sp.normalized_email IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_wide s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">country</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">marketing_consent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">click_count_30d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_open_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 45</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">excluded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segment_materialized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high_complaint_risk'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> excluded e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (subscriber_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suppression sp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">normalized_email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">normalized_email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subscriber_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">normalized_email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后两个 LEFT JOIN 是必须的，不能依赖分群表本身已经排除了退订者——分群是离线刷新的，退订是实时到达的，两者之间的时间差会在发送时变成违规（见 <a href=\"suppression-bounce-list\">退订/bounce/抑制名单</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"候选集物化的两个参数\">候选集物化的两个参数</h3><p>物化不是简单地把 <code>SELECT</code> 结果存表，需要额外声明两件事：<strong>新鲜度</strong>与<strong>基数上限</strong>。新鲜度决定候选集多久失效（营销活动可接受天级，触发型必须实时），基数上限则防止一个写错的规则（比如漏掉国家条件）生成一个覆盖全库的候选集把发送队列打爆。基数上限应当在物化时校验，超限直接报错而不是截断——静默截断会让&quot;这次发了 200 万&quot;变成一个无法复现的现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"名单导入管线\">名单导入管线</h2><p>从外部（合作方、线下活动、历史系统迁移）导入名单，是把风险带进系统的时刻。导入管线必须把校验做成<strong>拒绝式</strong>而非<strong>修正式</strong>：可疑记录不出现在结果里，而不是被静默修正后进库。</p>\n<p>典型管线的五个阶段：解析 → 规范化 → 去重 → 来源与同意校验 → 写入待确认队列。其中规范化与去重最容易被低估。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 邮箱规范化：用确定性规则生成去重键，不改变展示用原始地址&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION normalize_email(raw TEXT) RETURNS TEXT AS $$&#10;  SELECT CASE&#10;    WHEN position(&#39;@&#39; IN raw) = 0 THEN NULL&#10;    ELSE lower(split_part(raw, &#39;@&#39;, 1)) || &#39;@&#39; || lower(split_part(raw, &#39;@&#39;, 2))&#10;  END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE sql IMMUTABLE;&#10;&#10;-- 导入暂存表：先落盘，再校验，通过才进订阅库&#10;CREATE TABLE import_staging (&#10;  batch_id       TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  raw_email      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  normalized     TEXT,&#10;  source_channel TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  source_ref     TEXT,&#10;  row_num        INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  reject_reason  TEXT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (batch_id, row_num)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON import_staging (batch_id) WHERE reject_reason IS NOT NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 邮箱规范化：用确定性规则生成去重键，不改变展示用原始地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize_email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> position(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(split_part(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(split_part(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IMMUTABLE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 导入暂存表：先落盘，再校验，通过才进订阅库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> import_staging</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raw_email      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  normalized     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  row_num        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reject_reason  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (batch_id, row_num)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> import_staging (batch_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reject_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"规范化的边界\">规范化的边界</h3><p><code>normalize_email</code> 故意只做小写化，不做点号剥离或 <code>+</code> 后缀剥离。这个克制有协议依据：RFC 5321 明确规定邮箱的本地部分&quot;<strong>必须被视为大小写敏感</strong>&quot;，其语义&quot;只能由域名部分指定的主机解释&quot;，中间系统不应修改或重新解释它；尽管依赖大小写差异&quot;妨碍互操作性因此不被鼓励&quot;，协议层面的要求仍是保留其大小写，而域名部分按 DNS 规则不区分大小写（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5321\">RFC 5321</a>）。因此，把小写化当作&quot;安全的去重&quot;本身已经是一个折中——它假定所有目标主机都不做大小写区分，这在实践中绝大多数成立，但必须留下原始地址作为权威记录。</p>\n<p>Gmail 的&quot;点号无关&quot;与&quot;加号别名&quot;则是<strong>该提供商的特性</strong>，不是 SMTP 通用规则；对全部地址应用这些规则会把 <code>a.b@example.com</code> 和 <code>ab@example.com</code> 错误合并——而它们在大多数域名下是两个不同的人。处理这类参与者特定规则的正确位置是<strong>可选的、按域名白名单开启</strong>的增强规范化，而不是默认路径，并且必须保留原始地址用于展示与合规。地址长度上限也应当在校验时执行：本地部分最多 64 个八位组、域名部分最多 255 个八位组，总长上限 320（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3696\">RFC 3696</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"去重的判定优先级\">去重的判定优先级</h3><p>同一个人可能以多条记录存在：规范化邮箱相同、但注册渠道与同意记录不同。合并策略应当是<strong>保守的</strong>：只合并规范化邮箱完全相同的记录，把同意状态合并为&quot;任一记录有效同意即可发送&quot;，把撤回合并为&quot;任一记录撤回即全量抑制&quot;（抑制是单调的，取并集永远安全）。靠姓名或模糊匹配做合并，在跨境场景下几乎必然产生错误合并，而错误合并会把 A 的退订状态误判给 B，直接导致投诉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定信号</th>\n<th>合并策略</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规范化邮箱相同</td>\n<td>合并，同意取或、抑制取或</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮箱不同但同账号 ID</td>\n<td>保留为不同收件人，共享抑制状态</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>姓名 + 国家近似</td>\n<td><strong>不合并</strong>，仅标记供人工复核</td>\n<td>高（同名常见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊邮箱相似度</td>\n<td><strong>不合并</strong></td>\n<td>极高（拼写邻近是不同人）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时分群与离线分群的取舍\">实时分群与离线分群的取舍</h2><p>发送前的分群必须回答一个问题：这份名单是<strong>上次算好的</strong>还是<strong>现在算的</strong>？两种模式各有明确的适用场景，混用会造成&quot;人数对不上&quot;的经典困惑。</p>\n<p>离线分群（物化）适合大活动、条件复杂、对人数精度要求不高的场景——目标受众的规模按天变化，早一小时算出来的名单与现在算出来的差异在千分之一量级。实时分群适合触发型邮件与频次控制，因为这类场景下&quot;这个人是不是刚退订&quot;必须当场确认。</p>\n<p>工程上的折中是<strong>两段式</strong>：离线物化候选集，发送时对候选集做实时过滤。这样既避免了在发送高峰期跑重查询，又保证了抑制与频次的实时正确性。前文那条 SQL 正是这个形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分群条件分属性、行为、事件三类，对应预计算列、滚动窗口聚合、流式特征三种实现；混在一张明细表上查是性能崩塌的主因。</li>\n<li>规则应存成受限 JSON 并由编译器翻译成 SQL，字段白名单与操作符白名单既是安全边界也是性能边界；分群间的引用必须做环检测。</li>\n<li>候选集与抑制名单的求交必须在<strong>发送时</strong>做，不能依赖离线分群结果已经排除退订者。</li>\n<li>导入管线采用拒绝式校验：可疑记录不进库；来源与同意校验失败即拒绝，不做静默修正。</li>\n<li>邮箱规范化默认只做小写化，参与者特定规则（点号/加号别名）按域名白名单可选开启，并始终保留原始地址。</li>\n<li>去重只以规范化邮箱为准，同意取或、抑制取或；姓名与模糊匹配不得用于自动合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：导入记录进入系统后的状态流转与确认机制见 <a href=\"email-subscription-consent\">订阅同意与名单获取（GDPR）</a>；抑制名单的结构与只增不减约束见 <a href=\"suppression-bounce-list\">退订/bounce/抑制名单</a>；分群结果的发送节流与排期见 <a href=\"../campaign-orchestration/email-campaign-ab-schedule\">Campaign 编排与 A/B/排期</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"受众分群与名单导入","id":"受众分群与名单导入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类分群条件","id":"核心概念-三类分群条件"},{"level":2,"text":"分群规则的表达与编译","id":"分群规则的表达与编译"},{"level":3,"text":"白名单为什么比校验更重要","id":"白名单为什么比校验更重要"},{"level":3,"text":"环检测与深度上限","id":"环检测与深度上限"},{"level":3,"text":"候选集物化的两个参数","id":"候选集物化的两个参数"},{"level":2,"text":"名单导入管线","id":"名单导入管线"},{"level":3,"text":"规范化的边界","id":"规范化的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"去重的判定优先级","id":"去重的判定优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"实时分群与离线分群的取舍","id":"实时分群与离线分群的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订阅同意与名单获取（GDPR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/subscriber-audience-seg/email-subscription-consent"},"next":{"title":"退订/bounce/抑制名单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/subscriber-audience-seg/suppression-bounce-list"}}